# Line-ending policy for ArgusVision
#
# This worktree is shared between Windows editors and WSL-side agents reading
# through /mnt/d. Without a committed policy, every OS switch rewrites all line
# endings and buries real diffs in phantom churn (69 files / 15,962 lines, Jul 2026).
# .gitattributes travels with the repo; core.autocrlf would not.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never normalize, never diff as text.
*.pdf  binary
*.docx binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.pth  binary
*.pt   binary
*.zip  binary
